  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f867e729cd163844296773769e23f97f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Iztac
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Rarety: 1
  m_Description: "Once a sentinel of the jungle and a revered <i>Aztkal</i> warrior,
    <b>Iztac</b> was a sworn protector of his tribe.\\n With frost pulsing through
    his veins and ancestral magic shaping the ice at his command, he stood against
    the <i>human</i> invasions that scorched his homeland\u2014until his inevitable
    defeat at the hands of <b>Ryuko</b>.\\n \\n But in misfortune lay opportunity.
    Where others saw a beast in chains, <b>Ryuko</b> saw potential. <b>Iztac</b>
    received an offer he couldn\u2019t refuse:\\n \\n <i>\"Follow me, and by my word,
    your tribe will be spared.\"</i>\\n \\n From that day on, until his last breath,
    <b>Iztac</b> never left <b>Ryuko</b>\u2019s side. Day after day, the great principles
    that once guided his life were slowly stripped away, until all that remained
    was a singular, unshakable purpose: to serve his new king as a fearsome lieutenant
    in <b>Ryuko</b>\u2019s army.\\n \\n What was once a guardian of the jungle now
    slays the king\u2019s enemies\u2014<i>Aztkal</i> and <i>human</i> alike."
  m_DescriptionVariables: []
